# --- project rules, not defaults ---------------------------------------
# Full-resolution originals never enter this repo. The repo carries ~2400px
# web masters only; originals live in private storage with the backups.
# Named here as a second line of defence behind the CI size guard.
src/assets/originals/
**/*-original.*
**/*-full.*

